/* MP Loc Orphanage More2 —— 孤儿院第二批日常增量内容（Wave J）
   26 页：More2 Hub / 三个分区 Hub / Event 13-22 与 Season Extra 2 的「接近 → 结果」两页结构。
   只读写已有变量 $mpLocProgress_Orphanage、$mpLocEvents_Orphanage、$money 与各技能值；
   新增逐事件完成旗标 $mpDone_Orphanage_* 与结果变量 $mpOrphanEv*，不改 boot。
   接近页只写环境、人声与两个动作、不结算；结果页用 $mpOrphanEvN 分成败，失败只扣
   stress / tiredness / pain，不发钱、不退款、不动进度、不加线索与旗标。 */

:: MP Loc Orphanage More2 Hub [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "home">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<set $mpLocProgress_Orphanage to ($mpLocProgress_Orphanage or 0)>><<set $mpLocEvents_Orphanage to ($mpLocEvents_Orphanage or 0)>>
厨房后墙挂围裙的木钉上夹着一张对折的旧海报，背面用炭条列了十行：粮袋还能撑几天、哪个孩子在咳、昨夜哪张床空了、<<if mpNpcMet("Bailey")>>贝利<<else>>院长<</if>>哪天要逐间查看、收旧货的几点到后门、煤账上少了几笔、过冬的棉衣还差几件。<<if mpNpcMet("Robin")>>罗宾<<else>>管厨房的帮手<</if>>用一只豁口碗压住翘起的角，说账上的数目总比人要紧，剩下的得自己记。楼上的地板响了一声，像有人翻身。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回杂务木牌 (0:03)|MP Loc Orphanage More Hub]]>><<pass 3>><</link>><br><br>
<<mpfirstaidicon>><<link [[回院务与孩子们 (0:02)|MP Loc Orphanage More2 House]]>><<pass 2>><</link>><br>
<<if ($mpLocProgress_Orphanage or 0) gte 1>><<mpcellaricon>><<link [[去账目仓房 (0:03)|MP Loc Orphanage More2 Stores]]>><<pass 3>><</link>><br><</if>>
<<if ($mpLocProgress_Orphanage or 0) gte 2>><<mpdooricon>><<link [[到院外去 (0:04)|MP Loc Orphanage More2 Outside]]>><<pass 4>><</link>><br><</if>>
<<if ($mpLocProgress_Orphanage or 0) lt 1>>仓库的钥匙还在院长室，说得先办成一件事。<br><</if>>
<<if ($mpLocProgress_Orphanage or 0) gte 1 and ($mpLocProgress_Orphanage or 0) lt 2>>院外那扇后门的门闩坏了，得再办成一件事才有人肯修。<</if>>

:: MP Loc Orphanage More2 House [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "home">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<set $mpLocProgress_Orphanage to ($mpLocProgress_Orphanage or 0)>><<set $mpLocEvents_Orphanage to ($mpLocEvents_Orphanage or 0)>>
楼上的走廊有一股湿羊毛的味道。靠窗那张床的被子叠得歪，床头柜上搁着半瓶止咳糖浆；楼梯口的旧木箱夹层被孩子们塞得鼓起来；晚饭前，两个大孩子还会为一只手套在厨房门口顶牛。
<br><br>
<<if mpNpcMet("Robin")>>罗宾<<else>>管厨房的帮手<</if>>把一篮杂物搁在楼梯口，说孩子的事最急，也最不能急。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[回急务海报 (0:02)|MP Loc Orphanage More2 Hub]]>><<pass 2>><</link>><br><br>
<<if $mpDone_Orphanage_14>><<walkicon>><<link [[回孤儿院总枢去 (0:03)|MP Loc Orphanage Hub]]>><<pass 3>><</link>><br>退烧的孩子睡着了，额上的湿布换到天亮。<br><<else>><<mpfirstaidicon>><<link [[守着发烧的孩子 (0:12)|MP Loc Orphanage Event 14]]>><<pass 12>><</link>><br><</if>>
<<if $mpDone_Orphanage_16>>查房那晚走廊很安静，<<if mpNpcMet("Bailey")>>贝利<<else>>院长<</if>>没有翻箱倒柜。<br><<else>><<mpcleanicon>><<link [[赶在查房前收 (0:12)|MP Loc Orphanage Event 16]]>><<pass 12>><</link>><br><</if>>
<<if $mpDone_Orphanage_19>>两只手套分定了，大的和小的都戴上了手。<br><<else>><<socialiseicon>><<link [[评理手套 (0:12)|MP Loc Orphanage Event 19]]>><<pass 12>><</link>><br><</if>>
<<if $mpDone_Orphanage_Season2>>节令的饭食分了，锅底刮得干干净净。<br><<else>><<link [[张罗一锅节令饭食 (0:10)|MP Loc Orphanage Season Extra 2]]>><<pass 10>><</link>><br><</if>>

:: MP Loc Orphanage More2 Stores [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "home">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<set $mpLocProgress_Orphanage to ($mpLocProgress_Orphanage or 0)>><<set $mpLocEvents_Orphanage to ($mpLocEvents_Orphanage or 0)>>
粮柜的门合不严，铰链响得干涩；后门停过板车的地方留着两道车辙；账册摊在案板上，算盘被推到一边；阁楼搬下来的冬衣堆在长桌上，袖口短了一截。
<br><br>
这里的事都要过账。<<if mpNpcMet("Bailey")>>贝利<<else>>院长<</if>>只问数目对不对，可数目背后的东西往往比账本更重。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[回急务海报 (0:02)|MP Loc Orphanage More2 Hub]]>><<pass 2>><</link>><br><br>
<<if $mpDone_Orphanage_13>><<walkicon>><<link [[回孤儿院总枢去 (0:03)|MP Loc Orphanage Hub]]>><<pass 3>><</link>><br>粮袋重新装满了，锅里见了米粒。<br><<else>><<mpcookicon>><<link [[补上见底的粮袋 (0:12)|MP Loc Orphanage Event 13]]>><<pass 12>><</link>><br><</if>>
<<if $mpDone_Orphanage_17>>有名字的箱子留在了墙边，箱盖上的灰被擦掉。<br><<else>><<mpcalculateicon>><<link [[拦下收旧货的板车 (0:12)|MP Loc Orphanage Event 17]]>><<pass 12>><</link>><br><</if>>
<<if $mpDone_Orphanage_21>>煤账的缺口对上了，<<if mpNpcMet("Bailey")>>贝利<<else>>院长<</if>>没有再提扣工钱。<br><<else>><<link [[重核煤账 (0:12)|MP Loc Orphanage Event 21]]>><<pass 12>><</link>><br><</if>>
<<if $mpDone_Orphanage_22>>几个孩子穿上了改过的棉衣，袖口接到手腕。<br><<else>><<link [[凑齐过冬衣裳 (0:12)|MP Loc Orphanage Event 22]]>><<pass 12>><</link>><br><</if>>

:: MP Loc Orphanage More2 Outside [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "home">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<set $mpLocProgress_Orphanage to ($mpLocProgress_Orphanage or 0)>><<set $mpLocEvents_Orphanage to ($mpLocEvents_Orphanage or 0)>>
后门外那条夹道只容两人并肩，白天堆着别人家不要的木箱；阁楼的天窗通着屋顶，檐口那一片瓦早就松了；门厅的灯全点上时，慈善会的人就会提着篮子进门。
<br><br>
<<if mpNpcMet("Robin")>>罗宾<<else>>管厨房的帮手<</if>>说，院外的事一旦出了门，就不是院里能兜住的。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[回急务海报 (0:02)|MP Loc Orphanage More2 Hub]]>><<pass 2>><</link>><br><br>
<<if $mpDone_Orphanage_15>><<walkicon>><<link [[回孤儿院总枢去吧 (0:03)|MP Loc Orphanage Hub]]>><<pass 3>><</link>><br>夜出的孩子被领了回来，后门的灯亮到天亮。<br><<else>><<mpwatchicon>><<link [[提灯找夜出的孩子 (0:12)|MP Loc Orphanage Event 15]]>><<pass 12>><</link>><br><</if>>
<<if $mpDone_Orphanage_18>>屋顶的漏处盖上了油布，屋里不再滴水。<br><<else>><<mprepairicon>><<link [[上屋顶铺油布 (0:12)|MP Loc Orphanage Event 18]]>><<pass 12>><</link>><br><</if>>
<<if $mpDone_Orphanage_20>>慈善会的人走了，篮子底下多留了两袋面粉。<br><<else>><<socialiseicon>><<link [[接待慈善会的人 (0:10)|MP Loc Orphanage Event 20]]>><<pass 10>><</link>><br><</if>>
<<link [[看杂务牌 (0:04)|MP Loc Orphanage Chores Hub]]>><<pass 4>><</link>>

:: MP Loc Orphanage Event 13 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "home">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<set $mpLocProgress_Orphanage to ($mpLocProgress_Orphanage or 0)>><<set $mpLocEvents_Orphanage to ($mpLocEvents_Orphanage or 0)>>
粮柜拉开时铰链响了一声，燕麦袋瘪得贴在柜壁上，倒过来只抖出半捧碎末；土豆筐里滚着几颗发了芽的，干豆罐也见了底。楼上传来一阵闷闷的咳嗽，隔着楼板。<<if mpNpcMet("Robin")>>罗宾<<else>>管厨房的帮手<</if>>把手在围裙上擦了擦，说：「按现在的分法，最多还能撑三天。」案板底下堆着菜根和豆皮，街角的粮铺还开着，只是价钱比上月又涨了一截。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回仓房 (0:02)|MP Loc Orphanage More2 Stores]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>
<br>
<<mpcookicon>><<link [[熬一锅杂粮汤 (0:12)|MP Loc Orphanage Event 13 After]]>><<pass 12>><<if ($housekeeping or 0) gte 240 or ($physique or 0) gte 11000>><<set $mpOrphanEv13 to "ok">><<else>><<set $mpOrphanEv13 to "fail">><</if>><</link>>
<br>
<<shopicon>><<if ($money or 0) gte 170 or ($physique or 0) gte 11000>><<link [[补购麦片和干豆 (0:10)|MP Loc Orphanage Event 13 After]]>><<pass 10>><<if ($money or 0) gte 170>><<money -170>><<else>><<tiredness 1>><</if>><<set $mpOrphanEv13 to "ok">><</link>><<else>><span class="disabled">补购麦片和干豆 (0:10)（钱和力气都不够）</span><</if>>

:: MP Loc Orphanage Event 13 After [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "home">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<set $mpLocEvents_Orphanage to ($mpLocEvents_Orphanage or 0)>>
<<if $mpOrphanEv13 is "fail">>这一顿终究没有弄成样子。孩子们排着队，碗里的东西清得能照见灯影，最小的那个喝了两口就放下勺子。楼上的地板响了一声，催人熄灯。你收拾灶台时，手上留着一层洗不掉的涩味。<<stress 4>><<tiredness 2>><<pain 1>><<else>>粮柜那格重新鼓了起来，锅底见了米粒，热气顺着锅沿往上冒。孩子们捧着碗，谁也没有先动勺，等锅里最后一勺分完才低头吃。灶膛的火压下去时，屋里比先前暖了一层。<<set $mpDone_Orphanage_13 to 1>><<set $mpLocEvents_Orphanage += 1>><<set $mpLocProgress_Orphanage to Math.min(5, ($mpLocProgress_Orphanage or 0) + 1)>><<stress -2>><</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回仓房 (0:02)|MP Loc Orphanage More2 Stores]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>
<br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[返回急务海报 (0:03)|MP Loc Orphanage More2 Hub]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>

:: MP Loc Orphanage Event 14 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "home">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<set $mpLocProgress_Orphanage to ($mpLocProgress_Orphanage or 0)>><<set $mpLocEvents_Orphanage to ($mpLocEvents_Orphanage or 0)>>
靠窗那张床的被子攥成一团，孩子脸颊烧得通红，喉间带着细碎的哨音。<<if mpNpcMet("Robin")>>罗宾<<else>>管厨房的帮手<</if>>把手背贴上去，立刻缩回来：「烫得不像普通着凉。」床头柜里只剩半瓶结块的糖浆，厨房还存着生姜和干薄荷，街口的药铺这个时辰也亮着灯。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回院务 (0:02)|MP Loc Orphanage More2 House]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>
<br>
<<mpherbicon>><<link [[煮姜汤擦身 (0:12)|MP Loc Orphanage Event 14 After]]>><<pass 12>><<if ($tending or 0) gte 240 or ($science or 0) gte 240>><<set $mpOrphanEv14 to "ok">><<else>><<set $mpOrphanEv14 to "fail">><</if>><</link>>
<br>
<<shopicon>><<if ($money or 0) gte 120>><<link [[去药铺买退烧药 (0:10)|MP Loc Orphanage Event 14 After]]>><<pass 10>><<money -120>><<set $mpOrphanEv14 to "ok">><</link>><<else>><span class="disabled">去药铺买退烧药 (0:10)（钱不够）</span><</if>>

:: MP Loc Orphanage Event 14 After [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "home">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<set $mpLocEvents_Orphanage to ($mpLocEvents_Orphanage or 0)>>
<<if $mpOrphanEv14 is "fail">>窗缝里灌进冷风，湿布拧了一回又一回，热度到天亮也没有退下去。孩子迷糊着喊渴，水递到嘴边，大半顺着下巴流进领口。床尾守着的人一句话也没有说。<<stress 4>><<tiredness 3>><<pain 1>><<else>>热度退下去一层，孩子的呼吸慢慢匀了，额上的湿布不再烫手。天亮前他自己翻了个身，又把布偶抱回怀里。<<if mpNpcMet("Robin")>>罗宾<<else>>管厨房的帮手<</if>>把盆里的水泼到窗外，说这一夜算是熬过去了。<<set $mpDone_Orphanage_14 to 1>><<set $mpLocEvents_Orphanage += 1>><<set $mpLocProgress_Orphanage to Math.min(5, ($mpLocProgress_Orphanage or 0) + 1)>><<stress -2>><</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回院务 (0:02)|MP Loc Orphanage More2 House]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>
<br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[返回急务海报 (0:03)|MP Loc Orphanage More2 Hub]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>

:: MP Loc Orphanage Event 15 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "home">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<set $mpLocProgress_Orphanage to ($mpLocProgress_Orphanage or 0)>><<set $mpLocEvents_Orphanage to ($mpLocEvents_Orphanage or 0)>>
熄灯后<<if mpNpcMet("Robin")>>罗宾<<else>>管厨房的帮手<</if>>来敲门，说靠里那张床空了，窗子被推开一条窄缝，床底的鞋少了一双。后院的泥地上有一串浅脚印，一直通到后门。<<if $mpNpcs and $mpNpcs.lin and $mpNpcs.lin.hasMet>>林恩<<else>>守夜的老人<</if>>在街口那盏灯下打了个哈欠，说：「巷子深，别走太远。」
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回院外 (0:02)|MP Loc Orphanage More2 Outside]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>
<br>
<<mpwatchicon>><<link [[提灯沿巷寻找 (0:14)|MP Loc Orphanage Event 15 After]]>><<pass 14>><<if ($athletics or 0) gte 260 or ($willpower or 0) gte 300 or ($physique or 0) gte 11000>><<set $mpOrphanEv15 to "ok">><<else>><<set $mpOrphanEv15 to "fail">><</if>><</link>>
<br>
<<shopicon>><<if ($money or 0) gte 70>><<link [[塞给守夜人酒钱 (0:10)|MP Loc Orphanage Event 15 After]]>><<pass 10>><<money -70>><<set $mpOrphanEv15 to "ok">><</link>><<else>><span class="disabled">塞给守夜人酒钱 (0:10)（钱不够）</span><</if>>

:: MP Loc Orphanage Event 15 After [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "home">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<set $mpLocEvents_Orphanage to ($mpLocEvents_Orphanage or 0)>>
<<if $mpOrphanEv15 is "fail">>巷子里到处是碎砖和积水，两个来回走下来，灯油烧去一截，只捡到一只被踩扁的鞋。回院时后门的灯还亮着，走廊里没有人说话，楼上的床铺空着一张。<<stress 4>><<tiredness 3>><<pain 2>><<else>>找到孩子时，他缩在一处背风的角落，怀里抱着一只旧布包，冻得说不出话。外套裹上去，半扶半抱地往回走。后门的灯一直亮到天亮，门口的人接过他，才把提着的那口气松下来。<<set $mpDone_Orphanage_15 to 1>><<set $mpLocEvents_Orphanage += 1>><<set $mpLocProgress_Orphanage to Math.min(5, ($mpLocProgress_Orphanage or 0) + 1)>><<stress -2>><</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回院外 (0:02)|MP Loc Orphanage More2 Outside]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>
<br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[返回急务海报 (0:03)|MP Loc Orphanage More2 Hub]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>

:: MP Loc Orphanage Event 16 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "home">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<set $mpLocProgress_Orphanage to ($mpLocProgress_Orphanage or 0)>><<set $mpLocEvents_Orphanage to ($mpLocEvents_Orphanage or 0)>>
<<if mpNpcMet("Bailey")>>贝利<<else>>院长<</if>>在晚饭前宣布今晚逐间查看，说得轻描淡写，可桌上的人都停了勺子。楼道里的孩子开始拖床，木脚刮着地板，一阵紧过一阵。<<if mpNpcMet("Robin")>>罗宾<<else>>管厨房的帮手<</if>>把一只装杂物的篮子递过来，压低声音说：「能收的先收，他查东西从来不嫌麻烦。」
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回院务 (0:02)|MP Loc Orphanage More2 House]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>
<br>
<<mpcleanicon>><<link [[收拾零碎物 (0:12)|MP Loc Orphanage Event 16 After]]>><<pass 12>><<if ($housekeeping or 0) gte 240>><<set $mpOrphanEv16 to "ok">><<else>><<set $mpOrphanEv16 to "fail">><</if>><</link>>
<br>
<<shopicon>><<if ($money or 0) gte 100>><<link [[补钱填平亏空 (0:10)|MP Loc Orphanage Event 16 After]]>><<pass 10>><<money -100>><<set $mpOrphanEv16 to "ok">><</link>><<else>><span class="disabled">补钱填平亏空 (0:10)（钱不够）</span><</if>>

:: MP Loc Orphanage Event 16 After [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "home">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<set $mpLocEvents_Orphanage to ($mpLocEvents_Orphanage or 0)>>
<<if $mpOrphanEv16 is "fail">>楼上的脚步声一层层逼近，柜盖没有扣严，露出半截布角。伸手去压时，手心全是汗，等脚步声停在门口，走廊里已经来不及收拾。那一晚楼上的灯很晚才熄，楼下没有人敢出声。<<stress 4>><<tiredness 2>><<pain 1>><<else>>床底扫净，柜门关严，地板上拖出的痕也用湿布抹平了。<<if mpNpcMet("Bailey")>>贝利<<else>>院长<</if>>逐间走完，只在门口站了站，没有翻箱倒柜。灯端回楼梯口时，走廊里安静得能听见楼下灶火的噼啪。<<set $mpDone_Orphanage_16 to 1>><<set $mpLocEvents_Orphanage += 1>><<set $mpLocProgress_Orphanage to Math.min(5, ($mpLocProgress_Orphanage or 0) + 1)>><<stress -1>><</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回院务 (0:02)|MP Loc Orphanage More2 House]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>
<br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[返回急务海报 (0:03)|MP Loc Orphanage More2 Hub]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>

:: MP Loc Orphanage Event 17 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "home">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<set $mpLocProgress_Orphanage to ($mpLocProgress_Orphanage or 0)>><<set $mpLocEvents_Orphanage to ($mpLocEvents_Orphanage or 0)>>
后门停了一辆板车，收旧货的人蹲在车辕上抽烟。板车旁摞着几只从阁楼搬下来的旧木箱，箱盖上用粉笔写着名字，有的字迹已经模糊。<<if mpNpcMet("Robin")>>罗宾<<else>>管厨房的帮手<</if>>认出其中一只，说那是一个女孩留下的：「她走的时候说，回来再取。」
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回仓房 (0:02)|MP Loc Orphanage More2 Stores]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>
<br>
<<mpcalculateicon>><<link [[清点写下名字的箱 (0:12)|MP Loc Orphanage Event 17 After]]>><<pass 12>><<if ($maths or 0) gte 240 or ($willpower or 0) gte 320>><<set $mpOrphanEv17 to "ok">><<else>><<set $mpOrphanEv17 to "fail">><</if>><</link>>
<br>
<<shopicon>><<if ($money or 0) gte 180>><<link [[出钱买回旧物 (0:10)|MP Loc Orphanage Event 17 After]]>><<pass 10>><<money -180>><<set $mpOrphanEv17 to "ok">><</link>><<else>><span class="disabled">出钱买回旧物 (0:10)（钱不够）</span><</if>>

:: MP Loc Orphanage Event 17 After [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "home">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<set $mpLocEvents_Orphanage to ($mpLocEvents_Orphanage or 0)>>
<<if $mpOrphanEv17 is "fail">>板车一辆辆装满了，收旧货的人把最后一根麻绳勒紧。过道被木箱挡得进退不得，箱盖上那些浅浅的名字，被搬动时落下的灰盖住，再也认不出是谁的。院里的人各自散开，没有人再提这件事。<<stress 4>><<tiredness 2>><<pain 1>><<else>>写着名字的箱子留在了墙边，板车赶走后，后门过道一下子空出来。有人蹲下去，用袖子擦掉箱盖上的灰，露出底下那个浅浅的名字：「还在。」墙边的木箱被一只只摆正，靠在了不碍事的地方。<<set $mpDone_Orphanage_17 to 1>><<set $mpLocEvents_Orphanage += 1>><<set $mpLocProgress_Orphanage to Math.min(5, ($mpLocProgress_Orphanage or 0) + 1)>><<stress -1>><</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回仓房 (0:02)|MP Loc Orphanage More2 Stores]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>
<br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[返回急务海报 (0:03)|MP Loc Orphanage More2 Hub]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>

:: MP Loc Orphanage Event 18 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "home">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<set $mpLocProgress_Orphanage to ($mpLocProgress_Orphanage or 0)>><<set $mpLocEvents_Orphanage to ($mpLocEvents_Orphanage or 0)>>
<<if Weather.precipitation is "rain">>雨从后半夜下起，阁楼顶棚先洇出一块深色，随后一滴一滴往下落。<<else>>天阴了一整天，傍晚时瓦缝终于渗下水来，滴在床板上，声音很闷。<</if>><<if mpNpcMet("Robin")>>罗宾<<else>>管厨房的帮手<</if>>在漏处底下摆了两只盆，仰头看檐口那片松动的瓦：「上去得有人扶梯子。」后院的梯子还能用，杂货铺里也有一卷厚油布。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回院外 (0:02)|MP Loc Orphanage More2 Outside]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>
<br>
<<mprepairicon>><<link [[上屋顶铺油布 (0:14)|MP Loc Orphanage Event 18 After]]>><<pass 14>><<if ($athletics or 0) gte 240 or ($physique or 0) gte 11000>><<set $mpOrphanEv18 to "ok">><<else>><<set $mpOrphanEv18 to "fail">><</if>><</link>>
<br>
<<shopicon>><<if ($money or 0) gte 140>><<link [[买油布并请人搭手 (0:10)|MP Loc Orphanage Event 18 After]]>><<pass 10>><<money -140>><<set $mpOrphanEv18 to "ok">><</link>><<else>><span class="disabled">买油布并请人搭手 (0:10)（钱不够）</span><</if>>

:: MP Loc Orphanage Event 18 After [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "home">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<set $mpLocEvents_Orphanage to ($mpLocEvents_Orphanage or 0)>>
<<if $mpOrphanEv18 is "fail">>那夜屋里一直滴水，盆里的水满了又倒，倒了又满。被褥卷在楼梯口，湿的那床能拧出水。天快亮时，孩子们挤在走廊里，谁也没有睡踏实，顶棚的石灰还在一片片往下掉。<<stress 5>><<tiredness 3>><<pain 2>><<else>>漏处铺上了油布，四角用碎瓦压住，屋里那滴答声终于停住。下面有人举着灯看顶棚，说至少今晚能睡个干觉。孩子们抱着毯子回到床上，走廊的灯这才熄了。<<set $mpDone_Orphanage_18 to 1>><<set $mpLocEvents_Orphanage += 1>><<set $mpLocProgress_Orphanage to Math.min(5, ($mpLocProgress_Orphanage or 0) + 1)>><<stress -2>><</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回院外 (0:02)|MP Loc Orphanage More2 Outside]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>
<br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[返回急务海报 (0:03)|MP Loc Orphanage More2 Hub]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>

:: MP Loc Orphanage Event 19 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "home">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<set $mpLocProgress_Orphanage to ($mpLocProgress_Orphanage or 0)>><<set $mpLocEvents_Orphanage to ($mpLocEvents_Orphanage or 0)>>
争吵从楼梯口一直扯到厨房门口，小的那个被推倒，手肘在门槛上擦破一块皮。手套只有一副，是去年冬天别人捐的，指尖已经磨破。<<if mpNpcMet("Robin")>>罗宾<<else>>管厨房的帮手<</if>>把两个人分开，回头看你：「光骂没用，东西不够分，今天压下去，明天还得打。」
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回院务 (0:02)|MP Loc Orphanage More2 House]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>
<br>
<<socialiseicon>><<link [[分开评理重分 (0:12)|MP Loc Orphanage Event 19 After]]>><<pass 12>><<if ($willpower or 0) gte 300>><<set $mpOrphanEv19 to "ok">><<else>><<set $mpOrphanEv19 to "fail">><</if>><</link>>
<br>
<<shopicon>><<if ($money or 0) gte 80>><<link [[去旧货摊买手套 (0:10)|MP Loc Orphanage Event 19 After]]>><<pass 10>><<money -80>><<set $mpOrphanEv19 to "ok">><</link>><<else>><span class="disabled">去旧货摊买手套 (0:10)（钱不够）</span><</if>>

:: MP Loc Orphanage Event 19 After [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "home">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<set $mpLocEvents_Orphanage to ($mpLocEvents_Orphanage or 0)>>
<<if $mpOrphanEv19 is "fail">>两个孩子被分到两边，谁也不肯先开口。围着的孩子渐渐散了，地上的手套还躺着，指尖那块破洞越看越明显。灯被吹熄时，厨房门口还留着两道影子，谁也没有先走。<<stress 4>><<tiredness 2>><<pain 1>><<else>>手套的事说定了，两个孩子各自回床，走到楼梯口时，大的那个回头把小的扶了一把。手肘上的伤有人上过药，布条缠得整齐。厨房的灯熄下去，楼梯口终于安静。<<set $mpDone_Orphanage_19 to 1>><<set $mpLocEvents_Orphanage += 1>><<set $mpLocProgress_Orphanage to Math.min(5, ($mpLocProgress_Orphanage or 0) + 1)>><<stress -2>><</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回院务 (0:02)|MP Loc Orphanage More2 House]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>
<br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[返回急务海报 (0:03)|MP Loc Orphanage More2 Hub]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>

:: MP Loc Orphanage Event 20 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "home">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<set $mpLocProgress_Orphanage to ($mpLocProgress_Orphanage or 0)>><<set $mpLocEvents_Orphanage to ($mpLocEvents_Orphanage or 0)>>
慈善会的人要来，<<if mpNpcMet("Bailey")>>贝利<<else>>院长<</if>>把门厅的灯全部点上，又挑了四个穿戴整齐的孩子站在楼梯口。<<if mpNpcMet("Robin")>>罗宾<<else>>管厨房的帮手<</if>>一边往壶里添水一边低声说：「上回来人，粮柜锁了两天，客人一走，孩子们连粥都稀了两天。」桌布已经铺开，墙上那块补过的石灰还没遮住。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回院外 (0:02)|MP Loc Orphanage More2 Outside]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>
<br>
<<mpcleanicon>><<link [[收拾体面门厅 (0:12)|MP Loc Orphanage Event 20 After]]>><<pass 12>><<if ($housekeeping or 0) gte 240>><<set $mpOrphanEv20 to "ok">><<else>><<set $mpOrphanEv20 to "fail">><</if>><</link>>
<br>
<<shopicon>><<if ($money or 0) gte 90>><<link [[买点心摆上茶桌 (0:10)|MP Loc Orphanage Event 20 After]]>><<pass 10>><<money -90>><<set $mpOrphanEv20 to "ok">><</link>><<else>><span class="disabled">买点心摆上茶桌 (0:10)（钱不够）</span><</if>>

:: MP Loc Orphanage Event 20 After [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "home">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<set $mpLocEvents_Orphanage to ($mpLocEvents_Orphanage or 0)>>
<<if $mpOrphanEv20 is "fail">>客人走得比预想的早，门厅的灯还亮着，桌布上的水痕一道压着一道。茶盘收下去时已经没有热气，篮子里那些旧衣被搬进储藏室，糖果却没有分。楼上有人把窗推开，风灌进来，把桌布掀起了角。<<stress 4>><<tiredness 2>><<pain 1>><<else>>客人临走时又多问了两句，篮子底下留了两袋面粉。送到门口时，笑脸一直没有掉，转身回来才把肩膀松下来。面粉搬进厨房，袋子落地的声音很实，这一季的粥总算能稠一点。<<set $mpDone_Orphanage_20 to 1>><<set $mpLocEvents_Orphanage += 1>><<set $mpLocProgress_Orphanage to Math.min(5, ($mpLocProgress_Orphanage or 0) + 1)>><<stress -1>><</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回院外 (0:02)|MP Loc Orphanage More2 Outside]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>
<br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[返回急务海报 (0:03)|MP Loc Orphanage More2 Hub]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>

:: MP Loc Orphanage Event 21 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "home">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<set $mpLocProgress_Orphanage to ($mpLocProgress_Orphanage or 0)>><<set $mpLocEvents_Orphanage to ($mpLocEvents_Orphanage or 0)>>
账册摔在厨房的案板上，<<if mpNpcMet("Bailey")>>贝利<<else>>院长<</if>>说这个月的煤账少了整整两筐的钱，目光停在<<if mpNpcMet("Robin")>>罗宾<<else>>管账的人<</if>>脸上。<<if mpNpcMet("Robin")>>罗宾<<else>>管账的人<</if>>翻了两页，说每笔都按收据记的。算盘被推到一边：「要么补上，要么这个月工钱全扣。」你知道那两筐煤进了楼上小房间的炉膛。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回仓房 (0:02)|MP Loc Orphanage More2 Stores]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>
<br>
<<mpcalculateicon>><<link [[逐笔核对煤账 (0:14)|MP Loc Orphanage Event 21 After]]>><<pass 14>><<if ($maths or 0) gte 240 or ($science or 0) gte 240>><<set $mpOrphanEv21 to "ok">><<else>><<set $mpOrphanEv21 to "fail">><</if>><</link>>
<br>
<<shopicon>><<if ($money or 0) gte 200>><<link [[补上煤账的差额 (0:12)|MP Loc Orphanage Event 21 After]]>><<pass 12>><<money -200>><<set $mpOrphanEv21 to "ok">><</link>><<else>><span class="disabled">补上煤账的差额 (0:12)（钱不够）</span><</if>>

:: MP Loc Orphanage Event 21 After [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "home">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<set $mpLocEvents_Orphanage to ($mpLocEvents_Orphanage or 0)>>
<<if $mpOrphanEv21 is "fail">>账页上的数目挨得极密，有一页被水浸过，字迹晕开了半边。从头算了两遍，末了仍旧差一截。账册被取走时只被看了一眼，本子合上，卷起的页角也没有人再去压平。<<stress 4>><<tiredness 2>><<pain 1>><<else>>煤账的缺口对上了，几处写错的数目改回原样。清单抄好，趁人不在时放到桌上。第二天没有再提扣工钱的事，账册收进抽屉，卷起的页角被轻轻压平。<<set $mpDone_Orphanage_21 to 1>><<set $mpLocEvents_Orphanage += 1>><<set $mpLocProgress_Orphanage to Math.min(5, ($mpLocProgress_Orphanage or 0) + 1)>><<stress -2>><</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回仓房 (0:02)|MP Loc Orphanage More2 Stores]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>
<br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[返回急务海报 (0:03)|MP Loc Orphanage More2 Hub]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>

:: MP Loc Orphanage Event 22 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "home">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<set $mpLocProgress_Orphanage to ($mpLocProgress_Orphanage or 0)>><<set $mpLocEvents_Orphanage to ($mpLocEvents_Orphanage or 0)>>
<<if Weather.precipitation is "snow">>第一场雪落下来，后院的砖地很快白了。<<else>>入冬后的风一天比一天硬，窗缝里灌进来的气像刀子。<</if>>阁楼里存了一年的冬衣搬下来，堆在门厅的长桌上，袖口大多短了一截。<<if mpNpcMet("Robin")>>罗宾<<else>>管厨房的帮手<</if>>拿起一件小毛衣比了比：「这件还能再放一寸。」桌边还摊着针线、剪刀和一小包旧棉花。
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回仓房 (0:02)|MP Loc Orphanage More2 Stores]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>
<br>
<<mptailoricon>><<link [[改造两件旧大衣 (0:12)|MP Loc Orphanage Event 22 After]]>><<pass 12>><<if ($housekeeping or 0) gte 240 or ($tending or 0) gte 240>><<set $mpOrphanEv22 to "ok">><<else>><<set $mpOrphanEv22 to "fail">><</if>><</link>>
<br>
<<shopicon>><<if ($money or 0) gte 160>><<link [[买旧棉衣棉鞋 (0:10)|MP Loc Orphanage Event 22 After]]>><<pass 10>><<money -160>><<set $mpOrphanEv22 to "ok">><</link>><<else>><span class="disabled">买旧棉衣棉鞋 (0:10)（钱不够）</span><</if>>

:: MP Loc Orphanage Event 22 After [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "home">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<set $mpLocEvents_Orphanage to ($mpLocEvents_Orphanage or 0)>>
<<if $mpOrphanEv22 is "fail">>天黑了，桌上还摊着一堆没上身的冬衣。布料朽得厉害，缝到一半就裂开一道口子，拆下来的棉花结着块。孩子们穿着单衣在门厅里站了一会儿，脚冷了就各自散了，楼梯上传来一阵细碎的脚步声。<<stress 4>><<tiredness 2>><<pain 1>><<else>>几件冬衣上了身，袖口接到手腕，棉花塞得厚实。最小的那个把胳膊伸进袖子，半天没舍得脱下来。桌边剩下的碎布被收进针线篮，说这些还够补一冬。门厅的灯照着，比先前暖。<<set $mpDone_Orphanage_22 to 1>><<set $mpLocEvents_Orphanage += 1>><<set $mpLocProgress_Orphanage to Math.min(5, ($mpLocProgress_Orphanage or 0) + 1)>><<stress -2>><</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回仓房 (0:02)|MP Loc Orphanage More2 Stores]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>
<br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[返回急务海报 (0:03)|MP Loc Orphanage More2 Hub]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>

:: MP Loc Orphanage Season Extra 2 [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "home">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<set $mpLocProgress_Orphanage to ($mpLocProgress_Orphanage or 0)>><<set $mpLocEvents_Orphanage to ($mpLocEvents_Orphanage or 0)>>
厨房抽屉底压着一本没有封面的旧食谱，纸页被油烟浸得透亮，边角卷成一团。<<if mpNpcMet("Robin")>>罗宾<<else>>管厨房的帮手<</if>>说这是从前一位老厨娘留下的：「日子再紧，节令到了也得让人嘴里有点盼头。」案板上摊着今天凑得出的材料，够做一样。
<br><br>
<<if Time.season is "spring">>春天，墙根的雪化成了水，后院野地里的荠菜刚冒头。<<if Weather.precipitation is "rain">>雨把泥地泡得松软，挖回来的野菜得反复淘洗。<<else>>日头暖，午后风大，得赶早出门。<</if>>他把竹篮和两把钝口小铲搁在门槛上，说真要做，就得做够一人一个。
<<elseif Time.season is "summer">>夏天，厨房像蒸笼，去年存下的干酸梅还压在罐底。<<if Weather.precipitation is "rain">>雨后闷热，煮好的东西得赶紧吊进井里放凉。<<else>>井水冰凉，正适合把汤吊进去镇着。<</if>>他把罐子搬出来拣去发霉的，说今年还没煮过一回。
<<elseif Time.season is "autumn">>秋天，后院的新土豆刚起出来，南瓜也黄了皮。<<if Weather.precipitation is "rain">>雨点打在窖口的木板上，收回来的菜先摆在廊下吹一吹。<<else>>天高气爽，灶上多烧一会儿也不觉得热。<</if>>他把一只南瓜滚到案板边，说今年瓜不大，切开却是实心的。
<<elseif Time.season is "winter">>冬天，窗上结着冰花，最后一袋干豆还剩半袋。<<if Weather.precipitation is "snow">>雪把后门堵了半截，出去采买得绕远路。<<else>>天干冷，锅里的热气一冒出来就散。<</if>>他把袋子搬出来，说省着吃也撑不到开春。
<<else>>节气像停在了两个月份中间，天色发灰，分不清是冷还是潮。案板上摆着半袋粗面、几颗土豆和一小把干菜，够凑一锅热乎的。他把食谱翻到空白那页，说哪样先用得上就做哪样。
<</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回院务 (0:02)|MP Loc Orphanage More2 House]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>
<br>
<<mpcookicon>><<link [[凑一锅节令饭 (0:12)|MP Loc Orphanage Season Extra 2 After]]>><<pass 12>><<if ($housekeeping or 0) gte 240 or ($tending or 0) gte 240 or ($athletics or 0) gte 260>><<set $mpOrphanEvSeason2 to "ok">><<else>><<set $mpOrphanEvSeason2 to "fail">><</if>><</link>>
<br>
<<shopicon>><<if ($money or 0) gte 100>><<link [[出钱添节令食材 (0:10)|MP Loc Orphanage Season Extra 2 After]]>><<pass 10>><<money -100>><<set $mpOrphanEvSeason2 to "ok">><</link>><<else>><span class="disabled">出钱添节令食材 (0:10)（钱不够）</span><</if>>

:: MP Loc Orphanage Season Extra 2 After [nobr]
<<set $outside to 0>><<set $location to "home">><<effects>><<mpAmbient>><<set $mpLocEvents_Orphanage to ($mpLocEvents_Orphanage or 0)>>
<<if $mpOrphanEvSeason2 is "fail">>这一顿到底没有做成个样子。锅底焦了一层，孩子们在灶边等了半晌，最后各自散了。锅刷干净时，手指被热水烫得发红。食谱被合上，塞回抽屉最底下，说下回再试。<<stress 4>><<tiredness 2>><<pain 1>><<else>>饭食分下去了，每个孩子都捧到手里，锅底刮得干干净净。有人说明年还要吃这个，旁边的人笑着应了一声。厨房里只剩灶膛的余温，食谱塞回抽屉最底下，纸页上又添了一小块油印。<<set $mpDone_Orphanage_Season2 to 1>><<set $mpLocEvents_Orphanage += 1>><<set $mpLocProgress_Orphanage to Math.min(5, ($mpLocProgress_Orphanage or 0) + 1)>><<stress -2>><</if>>
<br><br>
<<getouticon>><<link [[返回院务 (0:02)|MP Loc Orphanage More2 House]]>><<pass 2>><</link>>
<br>
<<walkicon>><<link [[返回急务海报 (0:03)|MP Loc Orphanage More2 Hub]]>><<pass 3>><</link>>
